      "tagline": {
        "da": "Fangeleg mellem skyskrabere. Rør en anden, så er det dem, der er Den.",
        "en": "Tag between skyscrapers. Touch someone else and they become It."
      },
      "description": {
        "da": "Den, der er Den, skal røre en anden. Når tiden løber ud, vinder den, der har været Den i færrest sekunder. Du løber, dobbelthopper, dasher, løber på vægge og bruger gribekrog mellem tårne og svævende platforme. Falder du ned i voiden, starter du forfra på toppen. Spil solo mod bots, eller start et rum og få andre med via en kode på fire tal.",
        "en": "Whoever is It has to touch someone else. When time runs out, the player who has been It for the fewest seconds wins. You run, double jump, dash, wall-run and use a grappling hook between towers and floating platforms. Fall into the void and you start over at the top. Play solo against bots, or start a room and bring others in with a four digit code."
      },
